istics\", \"category\": \"Library Reserve and Textbook Material Comprehensive Analysis\", \"desc\": \"For each library reserve material detail with material status key 'U', show the reserve catalog key, subject offered key, term code, the academic year, the term description, the tip material key, the tip material status key, and the average record count in a window of 2 preceding and 2 following rows grouped by the tip material status key and ordered by the academic year, along with the average and variance of the record counter for reserve catalog items associated with that material status key where the catalog year is greater than 2000. Additionally, for each result, include the catalog title and catalog author name from the reserve catalog. Present the results ordered by academic year descending and record counter variance descending. Do not return any rounded answers.\"}, {\"metric_id\": \"dw_4584\", \"name\": \"Mathematics Library Subjects Above Yearly Average Enrollment in Previous Terms\", \"category\": \"Library Reserve and Enrollment Comprehensive Analysis\", \"desc\": \"For Mathematics department courses with at least 5 enrolled students, show the course number, subject title, number of enrolled students, term description, academic year, the row number within each academic year group ordered by course number, the term start date, calendar date, day of week, and the average calendar year within each calendar year group ordered by term start date, but only for academic terms where the term status is 'Previous', and only include results where the number of enrolled students is greater than the average number of enrolled students for that academic year. Do not return any rounded answers.\"}, {\"metric_id\": \"dw_4658\", \"name\": \"Mathematics Library Subjects 5+ Enrolled in Previous Terms with Faculty and Calendar Attributes\", \"category\": \"Library Reserve and Enrollment Comprehensive Analysis\", \"desc\": \"Show the Mathematics department courses with at 